Package: parkeze-base
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-ubus, uci, ip-full
Source: parkeze
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Parkeze gateway base configuration, identity and branding.
 Network defaults, device identity derived from board serial, the shared UCI
 schema every other Parkeze package reads, and the login banner — whose
 wordmark is rendered from a FIGlet font at print time, because OpenWrt
 packages no figlet to depend on.
